# Architecture

- Next.js App Router is the single web/server application.
- Supabase is the persistence/auth/storage backend.
- Schema source of truth is `supabase/migrations/*.sql`.
- Prefer feature folders and small components/services.
- Use Zod at external/server boundaries.
- Integrations are adapters under `src/lib/integrations` or feature server modules, never SDK calls inside React components.
- Keep business rules out of presentation components.
- Preserve stable HTTP/server contracts so a future Flutter client can reuse the backend.
- Use timestamptz and organization timezone; never scatter ad-hoc local date parsing.
